      "comment" : "A description of a SACD audio area, including the number of channels, whether it's a DST or DSD format, the number of tracks, and the duration of the audio. The first argument is the number of channels in the audio area. The second argument is whether the audio is in DST or DSD format. The third argument is the number of tracks in the audio area. The fourth argument is the string “%1$d:%2$02d”.",
